00:28:53.832 --> 00:28:55.641
with the same passion and love I had.

00:28:55.641 --> 00:28:57.297
They couldn't reciprocate it,

00:28:57.297 --> 00:28:58.940
so I already knew they was haters, right?

00:28:58.940 --> 00:29:01.661
And a couple weeks later, I
found out that I was banned,

00:29:01.661 --> 00:29:03.001
I couldn't speak there no more.

00:29:03.001 --> 00:29:05.085
I wanted, when I see 'em the next time,

00:29:05.085 --> 00:29:06.540
I'm going to give him a kiss in the mouth.

00:29:06.540 --> 00:29:08.265
(laughing)

00:29:08.265 --> 00:29:10.589
I said it, I'm going to give
my man a kiss in the mouth.

00:29:10.589 --> 00:29:11.594
Why?

00:29:11.594 --> 00:29:12.450
Because what he did for me was,

00:29:12.450 --> 00:29:14.692
when I got banned from
speaking from that region,

00:29:14.692 --> 00:29:16.673
when they told me I
couldn't speak no more,

00:29:16.673 --> 00:29:18.785
what I was able to do
was go to another level.

00:29:18.785 --> 00:29:19.790
Why?

00:29:19.790 --> 00:29:22.049
I was all over the place,
and I didn't have the ability

00:29:22.049 --> 00:29:23.307
to say no to churches.

00:29:23.307 --> 00:29:24.988
I didn't want to say no to churches,

00:29:24.988 --> 00:29:26.814
but when my man got me banned,

00:29:26.814 --> 00:29:28.853
he put me in a situation, you all,

00:29:28.853 --> 00:29:31.251
where I came home and I was focused.

00:29:31.251 --> 00:29:33.201
I was able to be more
focused at my church.

00:29:33.201 --> 00:29:35.613
I didn't miss any weeks,
because I was there,

00:29:35.613 --> 00:29:37.310
I was with my family after church.

00:29:37.310 --> 00:29:39.565
We were having, aah,

00:29:39.565 --> 00:29:40.975
you're not hearing what I'm telling you,

00:29:40.975 --> 00:29:42.082
my hater helped me.

00:29:42.082 --> 00:29:45.331
My hater helped me to stop being sporadic,

00:29:45.331 --> 00:29:46.514
being all over the place.

00:29:46.514 --> 00:29:48.270
My hater helped me to get focused.

00:29:48.270 --> 00:29:49.607
And let me tell you something,

00:29:49.607 --> 00:29:52.774
when I got focused, you can't finish a PhD

00:29:52.774 --> 00:29:54.130
and say, yeah to everybody.

00:29:54.130 --> 00:29:57.327
You can't finish a PhD and
have your hands in everything.

00:29:57.327 --> 00:30:00.491
You can't finish your PhD
and not be laser focused.

00:30:00.491 --> 00:30:02.074
My hater helped me.

00:30:02.074 --> 00:30:03.569
My wife wasn't trippin'.

00:30:03.569 --> 00:30:04.921
My wife was like, "If
that's what God told you,

00:30:04.921 --> 00:30:05.948
"then go do it."

00:30:05.948 --> 00:30:06.781
My loved ones was like,

00:30:06.781 --> 00:30:09.392
"Woo, dad traveling across
the country saving lives."

00:30:09.392 --> 00:30:11.376
But hater helped me.

00:30:11.376 --> 00:30:13.814
My hater, one, gives me a perspective

00:30:13.814 --> 00:30:15.111
that no one else will give me.

00:30:15.111 --> 00:30:16.964
Two, my hater puts me in a position

00:30:16.964 --> 00:30:18.336
that nobody else will push me.

00:30:18.336 --> 00:30:20.415
And let me tell you, finally, woo!

00:30:20.415 --> 00:30:24.022
My hater give me energy and
passion like nobody else.

00:30:24.022 --> 00:30:25.092
Let me tell you something.

00:30:25.092 --> 00:30:27.075
There are times when I'm
thinking about taking a nap,

00:30:27.075 --> 00:30:28.331
and I think about my hater.

00:30:28.331 --> 00:30:31.668
(laughs) Listen to me, there
are times when I think about

00:30:31.668 --> 00:30:32.783
doing something stupid.

00:30:32.783 --> 00:30:33.891
And I say to myself,

00:30:33.891 --> 00:30:37.302
"ET, if you mess up, do you
know how much, do you know how

00:30:37.302 --> 00:30:38.656
"your haters will relish in this?

00:30:38.656 --> 00:30:40.596
"Do you know if you
don't finish your degree

00:30:40.596 --> 00:30:42.065
"how much your haters will relish in this?

00:30:42.065 --> 00:30:45.232
"Do you know if you don't finish
your book, how much, aah!"

00:30:45.232 --> 00:30:46.558
My haters give me passion.

00:30:46.558 --> 00:30:48.068
My haters give me purpose.

00:30:48.068 --> 00:30:50.262
My haters, aah, you not hearing me.

00:30:50.262 --> 00:30:51.664
You hatin' on your haters.

00:30:51.664 --> 00:30:53.119
Don't hate on your haters.

00:30:53.119 --> 00:30:55.172
Love your haters, embrace your haters,

00:30:55.172 --> 00:30:58.355
listen to your haters, take
perspective from your haters,

00:30:58.355 --> 00:31:00.648
because your haters are
going to elevate you.

00:31:00.648 --> 00:31:04.129
Your enemy will elevate
you, not destroy you.

00:31:04.129 --> 00:31:05.687
So it's your boy ET saying

00:31:05.687 --> 00:31:06.915
you better stop trippin'.

00:31:06.915 --> 00:31:09.938
You better watch what
you say, you better watch

00:31:09.938 --> 00:31:11.096
what come out your mouth.

00:31:11.096 --> 00:31:13.106
Just because it don't look good for you,

00:31:13.106 --> 00:31:14.483
don't mean it ain't good for you.

00:31:14.483 --> 00:31:17.152
You better understand
that even your enemies

00:31:17.152 --> 00:31:18.222
can teach you something,

00:31:18.222 --> 00:31:20.443
even your haters can teach you something.

00:31:20.443 --> 00:31:23.708
So it's your boy saying,
"Haters, hate on!"

00:31:23.708 --> 00:31:27.115
(laughing) Haters, hate on!

00:31:27.115 --> 00:31:31.584
You don't destroy me,
you only make me better!

00:31:31.584 --> 00:31:33.021
- Thank you guys so much for watching,

00:31:33.021 --> 00:31:34.201
I hope you enjoyed it.

00:31:34.201 --> 00:31:37.752
It's hard not to be motivated
after watching this video.

00:31:37.752 --> 00:31:39.251
ET always delivers.

00:31:39.251 --> 00:31:42.688
I'm curious, which clip had
the biggest impact on you,

00:31:42.688 --> 00:31:43.692
and why?

00:31:43.692 --> 00:31:45.397
What messages did you take from this

00:31:45.397 --> 00:31:46.995
that you're going to immediately apply

00:31:46.995 --> 00:31:48.791
to your life or to your business somehow?

00:31:48.791 --> 00:31:51.572
Leave it in the comments below,
super curious to find out.

00:31:51.572 --> 00:31:53.142
I also want to give a
quick shout out to the

00:31:53.142 --> 00:31:55.441
Hawaii State Public Library System.

00:31:55.441 --> 00:31:57.208
I got a notification that you guys

00:31:57.208 --> 00:31:59.058
picked up a couple copies of my book

00:31:59.058 --> 00:32:00.784
and I really appreciate it.

00:32:00.784 --> 00:32:02.435
So I wanted to give you a quick shout out.

00:32:02.435 --> 00:32:04.519
So thank you for your
support of Your One Word.

00:32:04.519 --> 00:32:07.034
Thank you guys, again, for
watching, I believe in you,

00:32:07.034 --> 00:32:09.274
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:32:09.274 --> 00:32:11.443
and whatever your one word is.

00:32:11.443 --> 00:32:13.860
Much love, I'll see you soon.

